      "id": "note_label",
      "x": 70,
      "y": 632.5,
      "width": 1060,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "R2 keeps full sources, journals, and file versions.\nSQLite keeps the local journal and pending transfers.\nFailed summary? Cut working context until the full request fits.\nNo safe cut? Preserve evidence and report the limit.\nTheos counts calls. Fit cuts and overflow retries have no fixed cap.",
      "originalText": "R2 keeps full sources, journals, and file versions.\nSQLite keeps the local journal and pending transfers.\nFailed summary? Cut working context until the full request fits.\nNo safe cut? Preserve evidence and report the limit.\nTheos counts calls. Fit cuts and overflow retries have no fixed cap.",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "note",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false
    }
